{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "23a388365ed115d0e907d638057f286ce7d10957aee1869463cf0cb5379b7775", "ja": "あら、ちょうどよかったわ、{$P$}。\nアンタ今、ヒマなんでしょ？　話があるんだけど。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}，你来得正好。\n你现在很闲对吧？我有事要找你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3e662aee7fb86d6530add29836136d1bc3ec1b2ab1383b519474a2a0e84a7b49", "ja": "いや、別にヒマじゃないけど……。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "不，我不闲啊……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "9e47ca5e774cf008d9487e3acfa7975ee0da17ccd2b7b0d8dfe95fbae23d5031", "ja": "この衣装のことよ。その……アンタって本当に、\n唐突にいい仕事をするわよね。見直したわ。", "zh": "是关于这套服装啦。那个……你这个人啊，\n还真是会突然拿出好表现，我对你刮目相看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ae694697876ff7c87701fb3605f89a2f9c3846d8399395ce58e584989851ec6f", "ja": "ああ、その衣装か。うん、本当によく似合ってるよ。\nいや、着こなす伊織がすごいのかな？", "zh": "哦，你说那套服装啊。嗯，真的很适合你喔。\n不对，应该说，能驾驭自如的伊织才更厉害吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "1c404cce99270adab138f1186454ff41e593ee55f483e67b4388ff3fd3ecb16d", "ja": "あら、それはその通りだけど？", "zh": "哎呀，这不是理所当然的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d01c7313d30136aa963a00c16de2a3bae0afa38012c197d30d7482d4081f2fb9", "ja": "そ、そう……だな。", "zh": "就、就是……说嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "fa931c2584f0ec210a325feaaabdd981cc71f503c4f8ecf2de64a833b9a5eebe", "ja": "ほんと、最初メールを返してこなかった時は、\nタダじゃおかないんだからって思ったけど……。", "zh": "真是的，起初没收到简讯回复的时候，\n我还在想不能轻易饶过你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "d39322ed57c3e695af20f861aec20f2515e3f5b746a65a8aec3b58ecffeab261", "ja": "私のお願いをここまで叶えてくれたんだもの。\n仕方ないから、今回は特別に許してあげるわ♪", "zh": "但你都这么完美实现我的要求了，\n真没办法，这次就破例原谅你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "709a0cabec2885ad6ab994f9ec28af27447d539e5a7acab7ba6c64d62b93dddd", "ja": "メール？　お願い……？\nええと、伊織、なんの話をしてるんだ？", "zh": "简讯？要求……？\n呃，伊织，你在说什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "b1e74e35f5a701cbfe254fc49a7bbb9b27e96dfc3a08508f2b5385b06f62c5c1", "ja": "なによ、まだとぼける気？\nこの衣装を作る前に、私が送ったメールの話よ！", "zh": "什么嘛，还想继续装傻吗？\n我是指在制作这套服装前，我寄给你的简讯啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "a4ce3f4c9c89204c86cbcb6d3cea83538bafe6ed08d1a6980e31469929635802", "ja": "『バラの花モチーフの衣装ってステキね、アンタも\nそう思うわよね？』っていうメール、読んだんでしょ？", "zh": "『玫瑰花主题的服装很棒呢，你也这么觉得吧？』\n这封简讯你看过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
