{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9b60c87f1ce35c4f02ca000e9d4a2e06c1634e72bc42c4c2698b17aee7d6ef87", "ja": "待ってくれ、今、携帯をチェックして……", "zh": "等等我，我现在确认一下手机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
